# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  OpenJury – Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# This file is sourced by:
#   - Python (openjury.env.load_dotenv) — auto-loaded at runtime
#   - Bash   (set -a; source .env; set +a) — in generated SLURM scripts
#
# Environment variables always override values in this file.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── SLURM / Cluster Settings (required for sbatch jobs) ─────────
# These are cluster-specific — set them to match your HPC.

ACCOUNT=my_slurm_account
PARTITION=my_partition
TIME_LIMIT=02:00:00
# GPUS_PER_NODE=1

# ── Paths (required) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# USER_WORK_DIR: base directory for your work files.
USER_WORK_DIR=/path/to/my/workdir

# OPENJURY_PROJECT_DIR: OpenJury repo root (auto-detected if omitted).
OPENJURY_PROJECT_DIR=/path/to/OpenJury

# OPENJURY_DATA: where datasets and evaluation data are stored.
OPENJURY_DATA=/path/to/openjury-eval-data

# SLURM_WORK_DIR: where SLURM jobs write outputs (default: $USER_WORK_DIR/slurm_jobs).
SLURM_WORK_DIR=/path/to/slurm_jobs

# ── HuggingFace Cache ───────────────────────────────────────────
# HF_HOME: root directory for all HuggingFace caches.
HF_HOME=/path/to/hf_cache

# ── Optional Host Venv (non-container compute jobs) ─────────────
# OPENJURY_VENV: used by host-based compute jobs when not using Apptainer.
# OPENJURY_VENV=/path/to/venv

# ── Optional Apptainer Runtime (VLLM compute jobs) ──────────────
# OPENJURY_CONTAINER_RUNTIME: set to "apptainer" to containerize eligible
# VLLM compute-node SLURM jobs. Default: none.
# OPENJURY_CONTAINER_RUNTIME=apptainer

# OPENJURY_CONTAINER_IMAGE: pre-pulled .sif used for containerized VLLM jobs.
# OPENJURY_CONTAINER_IMAGE=/path/to/vllm-openai.sif

# OPENJURY_CONTAINER_HOME: persistent writable home mounted into the container.
# Prepare it once with `openjury-container-prepare`.
# If unset and HF_HOME is set, OpenJury defaults to "$HF_HOME/openjury_container_home".
# OPENJURY_CONTAINER_HOME=/path/to/openjury_container_home

# ── API Keys (secrets — NEVER commit this file with real values!) ─
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# LITELLM_API_KEY=...
